1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,020
There was a season I could only wave hello

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,620
Through the screen door at Mama, sitting on the tile below

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:11,220
They'd stand out on the lawn just to see me for a while

4
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:14,740
And I'd make them all a promise with a tired little smile

5
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,420
Now I got sand between my toes and my arms around them tight

6
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:21,860
No glass, no screen, no distance, just a bonfire glowing bright

7
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:25,300
So if I hold you a little longer than you think I should

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:28,820
It's 'cause I remember when I couldn't, and now I finally could

9
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:32,580
So bring the whole ohana, bring the cousins and the kids

10
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:36,020
Bring the stories that we tell about the crazy things we did

11
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:40,020
Mama's in the kitchen with the recipe she never wrote down

12
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:43,700
Someone's got a guitar and the whole yard gathers round

13
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:47,140
Fire up the grill, let the music drift away

14
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:50,180
Nobody here is leaving early today

15
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:54,180
And when the stars come out and the little ones are sleeping

16
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:57,940
That's the kind of rich that's worth the keeping

17
00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:58,800
Everybody's hustling like there's somewhere else to be
